:18.774" end="00:19.348">I </span><span begin="00:19.348" end="00:19.685">used </span><span begin="00:19.685" end="00:19.991">to </span><span begin="00:19.991" end="00:20.293">be </span><span begin="00:20.293" end="00:20.570">so </span><span begin="00:20.570" end="00:22.026">strong</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.729" end="00:24.869"><span begin="00:21.729" end="00:22.348">Your </span><span begin="00:22.348" end="00:22.695">arms </span><span begin="00:22.695" end="00:23.165">around </span><span begin="00:23.165" end="00:23.596">me </span><span begin="00:23.596" end="00:24.861">tight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.572" end="00:28.133"><span begin="00:24.572" end="00:25.121">Everything </span><span begin="00:25.121" end="00:25.474">it </span><span begin="00:25.474" end="00:25.860">felt </span><span begin="00:25.860" end="00:26.250">so </span><span begin="00:26.250" end="00:28.125">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.833" end="00:32.444"><span begin="00:27.833" end="00:28.461">Unbreakable </span><span begin="00:28.461" end="00:30.040">like </span><span begin="00:30.040" end="00:30.368">nothing </span><span begin="00:30.368" end="00:31.079">could </span><span begin="00:31.079" end="00:31.351">go </span><span begin="00:31.351" end="00:32.437">wrong</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.657" end="00:35.549"><span begin="00:32.657" end="00:33.202">Now </span><span begin="00:33.202" end="00:33.480">I </span><span begin="00:33.480" end="00:33.884">can't </span><span begin="00:33.884" end="00:35.548">breathe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.249" end="00:38.058"><span begin="00:35.249" end="00:35.802">No </span><span begin="00:35.802" end="00:36.193">I </span><span begin="00:36.193" end="00:36.730">can't </span><span begin="00:36.730" end="00:38.054">sleep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.758" end="00:42.953"><span begin="00:37.758" end="00:38.521">I'm </span><span begin="00:38.521" end="00:39.311">barely </span><span begin="00: